03:05:37,902 --> 03:05:48,452
通过了解通用的接口，我希望你们能更从容地接受“不完全了解某事是如何运作的，
但仍依靠这种抽象来构建工具和应用”这种想法。
By looking at interfaces in general, I hope you're more comfortable with the idea of not fully understanding exactly how something is
working, but still leaning on that abstraction to build your tools and applications.

2899
03:05:49,008 --> 03:05:53,636
无论是物理对象的接口，还是 API，也就是应用程序编程接口，都是如此。
Do this all the time with physical object interfaces and APIs or application programming interfaces.

2900
03:05:53,888 --> 03:05:54,948
它们其实没那么大的区别。
They aren't all that different.

2901
03:05:55,470 --> 03:05:56,928
我希望你们喜欢这门课程。
I hope you enjoyed taking this course.

2902
03:05:57,390 --> 03:05:59,008
我知道我在制作它时非常开心。
I know I had a lot of fun making it.

2903
03:05:59,342 --> 03:06:03,008
如果你觉得你认识的人可能会从这门课程中受益，请把它分享给他们。
If you think someone you know might benefit from this course, please share it with them.

2904
03:06:03,278 --> 03:06:05,540
我很想听到你们的感受、想法和梦想。
I'd love to hear your feelings, your thoughts, your dreams.

2905
03:06:05,838 --> 03:06:10,048
所以我用一些 API 凑出了一个小工具来收集你们的反馈。
So I threw together a little something using a smattering of APIs to capture your feedback.

2906
03:06:10,288 --> 03:06:14,692
如果你有时间的话，我很希望你能回答一个简单的文字调查。
If you've got the time, I'd love to have you answer a quick text-based survey.

2907
03:06:15,054 --> 03:06:17,168
把文字反馈发到屏幕上的号码上。
Text feedback to the number on your screen.

2908
03:06:17,422 --> 03:06:18,608
嗯，其实，你知道吗？
Well, actually, you know what?

2909
03:06:18,798 --> 03:06:21,888
如果你愿意的话，你也可以打电话给我并给我留言。
If you want, you can also call and just leave me a message too.

2910
03:06:22,094 --> 03:06:23,428
我也会用 API 来处理那个。
I use an API for that too.

2911
03:06:23,854 --> 03:06:28,804
所以请，请，务必随时告诉我你的进展，我真的迫不及待想看到你们的作品了。
So please, please, please keep me posted on your journey and really I can't wait to see what you build.

2912
03:06:29,198 --> 03:06:31,968
再次感谢大家的陪伴，我们很快再见。
Thanks again for hanging out, and we'll see you real soon.

